# leon

--- Ninja_InvisibleArea | gadget | TID_NINJA_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Leon throws a stealthy area for his team to hide in. The lollipop slowly loses its health over time. Leon and teammates gain <!buddy.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.areaEffect.statusEffectAlly.speedBoostPercent>% movement speed inside the area.
now  Leon throws a stealthy area for his team to hide in. The lollipop slowly loses its health over time. Leon and teammates gain 15% movement speed inside the area.
  buddy.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.areaEffect.statusEffectAlly.speedBoostPercent  15  -> 15

--- Ninja_InvisibleArea | gadget | TID_NINJA_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DIFF
raw  Leon and teammates gain <!buddy.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.areaEffect.statusEffectAlly.speedBoostPercent>% movement speed inside the area.
now  Leon and teammates gain 15% movement speed inside the area.
  buddy.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.areaEffect.statusEffectAlly.speedBoostPercent  15  -> 15

--- Ninja_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_NINJA_BUDDY_OVERCHARGE_DESC
raw  Leon's main attacks do at least <!card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.projectile.damagePercentEnd>% damage regardless of distance.
now  Leon's main attacks do at least 75% damage regardless of distance.
  card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.projectile.damagePercentEnd  75  -> 75

--- Ninja_overcharge | hypercharge | TID_NINJA_BUDDY_OVERCHARGE_DIFF
raw  Leon's main attacks do at least <!card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.projectile.damagePercentEnd>% damage regardless of distance.
now  Leon's main attacks do at least 75% damage regardless of distance.
  card.character.weaponSkill.overchargedVersion.projectile.damagePercentEnd  75  -> 75

--- Ninja_unique | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_SPEED_INVISIBLE_DESC
raw  When Leon is not visible, he gains a <!card.statuseffect.speedboostpercent>% movement speed for the duration of his invisibility.
now  When Leon is not visible, he gains a 30% movement speed for the duration of his invisibility.
  card.statuseffect.speedboostpercent  30  -> 30

--- Ninja_unique | star power | TID_NINJA_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DESC
raw  When Leon is not visible, he gains <!card.statuseffect.speedboostpercent>% movement speed for the duration of his invisibility. Projectiles deal +<!buddy.trait.statusEffect.DamageBoostPercent>% damage for <!buddy.trait.statuseffect.duration.ticksasseconds> seconds after breaking invisibility.
now  When Leon is not visible, he gains 30% movement speed for the duration of his invisibility. Projectiles deal +15% damage for 0.5 seconds after breaking invisibility.
  card.statuseffect.speedboostpercent  30  -> 30
  buddy.trait.statusEffect.DamageBoostPercent  15  -> 15
  buddy.trait.statuseffect.duration.ticksasseconds  0.5  -> 0.5

--- Ninja_unique | star power | TID_NINJA_BUDDY_STARPOWER_1_DIFF
raw  The first attack after breaking invisibility deals +<!buddy.trait.statusEffect.DamageBoostPercent>% damage.
now  The first attack after breaking invisibility deals +15% damage.
  buddy.trait.statusEffect.DamageBoostPercent  15  -> 15

--- Ninja_unique_2 | star power | TID_SPEC_ABI_HOT_INVISIBLE_DESC
raw  Leon recovers <!card.character.maxHealth.scaleToLevel.scaleCardValue1> health per second while his Super is active.
now  Leon recovers 1320 health per second while his Super is active.
  card.character.maxHealth.scaleToLevel.scaleCardValue1  1320  -> 1320

--- Ninja_unique_2 | star power | TID_NINJA_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DESC
raw  Leon recovers <!card.character.maxHealth.scaleToLevel.scaleCardValue1> health per second while his Super is active and his Super duration is +<!buddy.trait.value.AddActiveTimeUltiAttackPercentage> sec longer.
now  Leon recovers 1320 health per second while his Super is active and his Super duration is +<!buddy.trait.value.AddActiveTimeUltiAttackPercentage> sec longer.
  card.character.maxHealth.scaleToLevel.scaleCardValue1  1320  -> 1320
  buddy.trait.value.AddActiveTimeUltiAttackPercentage  -  -> 1

--- Ninja_unique_2 | star power | TID_NINJA_BUDDY_STARPOWER_2_DIFF
raw  Leon's Super duration is +<!buddy.trait.value.AddActiveTimeUltiAttackPercentage> sec longer.
now  Leon's Super duration is +<!buddy.trait.value.AddActiveTimeUltiAttackPercentage> sec longer.
  buddy.trait.value.AddActiveTimeUltiAttackPercentage  -  -> 1
